:: Forest - toll ambush [bg-forest]
<h1 class="ptitle">FOREST</h1>
<br />

<<set _tollNpc = setup.getNpcById($forestTollEvent.npcId) ?? $guests[$forestTollEvent.npcIndex]>> /* npcIndex: events saved before the id was stored */

<!-- #### forest_toll_ambush.jpg | Post-apocalyptic forest edge at dawn, a beaten survivor limping out of the trees toward a worn wooden cabin, split lip, hand wrapped in a dirty rag, empty torn sack hanging from the shoulder, dusty patched clothes, cold grey morning light, grim quiet atmosphere, cinematic composition --ar 5:3 --p -->

<<=setup.displayName(_tollNpc)>> came back out of the trees just before dawn, walking slowly, one hand held tight against <<=setup.pronounceWhos(_tollNpc)>> chest. Split lip. Two fingers bent the wrong way. The sack <<=setup.pronounceWhat(_tollNpc)>> had filled was gone.
<br /><br />

<<sayNpc _tollNpc>>
	He didn't even say anything. Just took it and told me to tell you the price went up.
<</sayNpc>>
<br />

You had refused to pay. The point had been made.
<br /><br />

<strong>(<<=setup.displayName(_tollNpc)>>: Happy −20, Relationship −10, sick <<=_tollNpc.sick.days>> days)</strong>
<br /><br />

<div id="fta_hunt">
<<linkreplace 'Hunt them down'>>
	<<run $('#fta_letgo').hide()>>
	<<set $forestTollEvent = null>>
	<<goto 'Forest - toll retaliation'>>
<</linkreplace>>
</div>
<div id="fta_letgo">
<<linkreplace 'Let it go'>>
	<<run $('#fta_hunt').hide()>>
	<<set $forestTollEvent = null>>
	You swallow it. For now.
	<br /><br />
	<<link 'Continue'>>
		<<goto 'Wood cabin'>>
	<</link>>
<</linkreplace>>
</div>
